:"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgwODI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gdscript","name":"topic:gdscript","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":2,"created_at":"2025-02-26T08:16:05Z","updated_at":"2025-04-06T10:17:42Z","closed_at":"2025-04-06T10:17:32Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nv4.4.rc1\n\n### System information\n\nWindows 10, v4.4.rc1\n\n### Issue description\n\nI am using the VSCode plugin for Godot. When editing a GDScript file with a `class_name` ,while godot and as such the LSP is not running, such that there is an error in the file, `GDScriptLanguageProtocol::initialize` will not be called once godot is restarted and VSCode connects to the LSP. This results in `workspace->root_uri` being empty which then results in\n```\nerror while getting cache for script \"file:res:/res:/res:/e:res:/Devres:/gw2cc_publicres:/libccres:/resourcesres:/CharacterState.gd\"\n\n<modules\\gdscript\\gdscript.cpp(1115): GDScript::load_source_code> Condition \"err\" is true. Returning: err:\nAttempt to open script 'file:res:/res:/res:/e:res:/Devres:/gw2cc_publicres:/libccres:/resourcesres:/CharacterState.gd' resulted in error 'File not found'.\n```\n\nand\n```\nClass \"CharacterState\" hides a global script class.\n```\n\nFixing the error and restarting VSCode will fix the issue.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nCreate a custom resource with a `class_name` and add some export properties with setters. Close godot and edit the file in VScode to produce an error. Restart godot. Get flooded with errors.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n```\nextends Resource\nclass_name CharacterState\n\n@export var profession: int: set = set_professio\nvar _hash: int = 0\n\nfunc set_profession(value: int) -> void:\n\t_hash = 0\n\tprofession = value\n```","closed_by":{"login":"HolonProduction","id":99511741,"node_id":"U_kgDOBe5tvQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/99511741?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction","html_url":"https://github.com/HolonProduction","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103313/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103313/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"duplicate","pinned_comment":null}